+- ANOMALY: Keychain creation metadata is `2026-07-05T02:04:52Z`, while Ceremony C1 began on 2026-07-28. Sparkle 2.9.4 reuses an existing key rather than overwriting it, so current evidence confirms existence/custody but cannot attest that C1 generated this key. Owner input must either accept intentional C1 adoption of the pre-existing key or reopen C1 for controlled replacement; no key material was regenerated, exported, or moved.
+- BOUNDARY: `SUPublicEDKey` pinning, CI binding, and payload/appcast sign/verify remain open under `TASK-260728-3bj9bk`. Its rotation proof must account for the project's signed-feed failure expiration of `0`, which disables Sparkle's documented lost-key feed fallback.

