+  private-context Base64 candidates.
+
+The scanner emits counts and file identities only, never matching content. The
+final counts and real exit codes are recorded in the board outcome. Public-key
+occurrences are expected non-secret evidence and are not classified as leaks.
+
+## Fact-checking and sources
+
