+| Repository Git scope | 3,042 | 558,493,488 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
+| Authoritative board resources | 1,882 | 543,503,708 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
+| Task/run logs (also included above) | 764 | 522,060,592 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
